02:48:17.400 --> 02:48:18.760
I don't look that bad.

02:48:20.780 --> 02:48:23.500
They have the same energy and energy.

02:48:25.320 --> 02:48:28.420
And she's not afraid of anything.

02:48:30.580 --> 02:48:36.800
When Vaziria says something, it overlaps with what he said in Stardom.

02:48:37.890 --> 02:48:39.820
I have to say something, too.

02:48:39.840 --> 02:48:40.240
That's right.

02:48:40.560 --> 02:48:40.800
That's right.

02:48:41.120 --> 02:48:43.480
It's not like a retired player is sitting here.

02:48:43.640 --> 02:48:44.060
I understand.

02:48:44.540 --> 02:48:46.000
You're saying that you're going to pass on the generation.

02:48:47.280 --> 02:48:48.300
That's not it.

02:48:48.680 --> 02:48:48.940
That's right.

02:48:49.140 --> 02:48:51.140
But I thought about one thing.

02:48:53.640 --> 02:48:58.370
I've been participating in Five Star for years.

02:49:00.000 --> 02:49:01.120
Maika was also with us.

02:49:01.680 --> 02:49:04.610
Maika was seriously aiming for it.

02:49:05.610 --> 02:49:06.750
I was so excited that I thought I had to win this year.

02:49:11.950 --> 02:49:15.620
So from the bottom of my heart...

02:49:15.620 --> 02:49:20.840
Of course, I'm happy that Suzu came up.

02:49:22.000 --> 02:49:25.290
But I have high expectations for Maika's victory.

02:49:27.730 --> 02:49:29.680
But I couldn't get it.

02:49:30.000 --> 02:49:32.080
So I was like, what's the reason for that?

02:49:32.620 --> 02:49:35.420
But I don't think there's a big difference between the two.

02:49:35.920 --> 02:49:38.420
What I thought was,

02:49:38.580 --> 02:49:42.020
Suzu has a big goal of becoming the face of the pro-wrestling world.

02:49:44.570 --> 02:49:47.270
Maika has always been a fan of someone.

02:49:47.470 --> 02:49:50.150
A fan of Utami. A fan of Julia.

02:49:50.930 --> 02:49:52.670
It's not like that.

02:49:52.990 --> 02:49:55.980
Maybe it's the same for me and Utami.

02:49:56.660 --> 02:49:58.220
Suzu too.

02:50:00.000 --> 02:50:04.080
It's not like that. I don't think I'm doing pro-wrestling because I'm trying to wake someone up.

02:50:04.080 --> 02:50:14.740
I think I'm going further and I'm doing it for that reason, so I think I'm getting results like this.

02:50:15.860 --> 02:50:25.280
Maika already has enough power, so I really want to think only about myself and see it next year.

02:50:30.280 --> 02:50:38.960
I don't know if it's a tie-booster or a single belt, but Maika's mind has changed a lot lately.

02:50:38.960 --> 02:50:40.100
Himeka's retirement and so on.

02:50:40.660 --> 02:50:41.500
I think they'll do it soon.

02:50:45.320 --> 02:50:50.590
I thought it was a fight that made me look forward to it.

02:50:51.990 --> 02:50:54.940
That means you still have a long way to go.

02:50:55.940 --> 02:50:58.080
Yes, I'm still aiming for the top.

02:51:00.090 --> 02:51:04.400
I think it's a great thing. That's why I think it's worth cheering for.

02:51:05.000 --> 02:51:09.010
I think I've already set the winning card this year.

02:51:09.790 --> 02:51:10.710
I've already set it in the pamphlet.

02:51:10.930 --> 02:51:14.610
I've already set it, but I've already said that the winner is Maika.

02:51:15.950 --> 02:51:24.910
So, I've always had a lot of expectations from Maika, and I think I'm still building up the flame.

02:51:26.790 --> 02:51:29.650
I think the customers are all like that.

02:51:30.000 --> 02:51:32.440
I think there were a lot of people who felt that way.

02:51:33.180 --> 02:51:35.440
I think there were a lot of people who were frustrated.

02:51:37.080 --> 02:51:38.800
Maika herself is the same.

02:51:39.160 --> 02:51:43.080
I hope Maika will make a big explosion with this frustration.

02:51:44.870 --> 02:51:49.460
I want to see Maika's fight next year.

02:51:51.310 --> 02:51:55.040
It's about time to say goodbye.

02:51:55.040 --> 02:51:56.360
It's getting close to the end of the tournament.

02:52:01.850 --> 02:52:23.580
10.9, Aichi Dolphins Arena, 10.15, Gottes of Stardom, 11.29, Tachikawa Stage Garden, 11.12, Niigata, Oore, Nagaoka, Gottes of Tag League, 11.18, Osaka Edion Arena,

02:52:23.580 --> 02:52:24.360
The arena is lined up for the first match.

02:52:25.560 --> 02:52:28.770
I'm wearing a red belt with Suz.

02:52:30.060 --> 02:52:31.580
I see. That's what you were aiming for.

02:52:31.840 --> 02:52:32.580
I think I was aiming for it.

02:52:33.120 --> 02:52:33.500
I'm sure you were aiming for it.

02:52:34.880 --> 02:52:38.820
There will be many other competitions, so please come to the next venue.

02:52:41.020 --> 02:52:45.840
Then, let's finish the live broadcast with Julia's pose.

02:52:49.350 --> 02:52:52.250
Thank you for your support for the long 5-star 2-month period.

02:52:55.820 --> 02:52:58.240
We have Korakuen tomorrow, too.

02:53:00.000 --> 02:53:01.680
We will do our best in the future as well.

02:53:02.580 --> 02:53:03.560
Please keep an eye on Stardom.

02:53:06.200 --> 02:53:06.560
Yes.

02:53:06.940 --> 02:53:07.360
See you.

02:53:09.150 --> 02:53:09.870
See you.
